      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Chain a multiple of 8 plus 2. Row 1: dc in each ch. Turn." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Point rows (rows 2 to 5)" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Row 2: *skip 2 dc, 7 tr into next dc (triangle base), skip 2 dc, dc in next dc; repeat from * across. Row 3: ch 3, turn, tr2tog, tr, tr2tog (5 tr per point). Row 4: ch 3, tr2tog, tr2tog (3 tr). Row 5: ch 3, tr2tog (1 tr tip, point row). Fasten off." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
